<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<title>AgentShield Executive Summary · {{ session_id[:8] }}</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 22mm 18mm; }
  body {
    font-family: -apple-system, "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", "Noto Sans KR", "Malgun Gothic", sans-serif;
    color: #0f172a;
    font-size: 11pt;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  header {
    border-bottom: 2px solid #1e293b;
    padding-bottom: 8mm;
    margin-bottom: 8mm;
  }
  .brand {
    font-size: 10pt;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: #64748b;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 4mm;
  }
  h1 { font-size: 22pt; margin: 0 0 2mm 0; }
  .meta { font-size: 9.5pt; color: #475569; }
  .meta span { margin-right: 6mm; }
  h2 {
    font-size: 13pt;
    margin: 8mm 0 3mm 0;
    padding-bottom: 1mm;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
  }
  .stats {
    display: flex;
    gap: 4mm;
    margin: 4mm 0;
  }
  .stat-card {
    flex: 1;
    border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
    border-radius: 3mm;
    padding: 3mm 4mm;
  }
  .stat-card .label { font-size: 8.5pt; color: #64748b; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; }
  .stat-card .value { font-size: 18pt; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 1mm; }
  .stat-card.vuln .value { color: #b91c1c; }
  .stat-card.safe .value { color: #047857; }
  .stat-card.verified .value { color: #6d28d9; }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin: 3mm 0;
    font-size: 10pt;
  }
  th, td {
    border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
    padding: 2.5mm 3mm;
    text-align: left;
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  th { background: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 700; }
  .pill {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.5mm 2mm;
    border-radius: 1.5mm;
    font-size: 8.5pt;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .pill.high { background: #fee2e2; color: #991b1b; }
  .pill.critical { background: #fecaca; color: #7f1d1d; }
  .pill.medium { background: #fef3c7; color: #92400e; }
  .pill.low { background: #d1fae5; color: #065f46; }
  .note {
    background: #f8fafc;
    border-left: 3px solid #6d28d9;
    padding: 3mm 4mm;
    margin: 4mm 0;
    font-size: 9.5pt;
    color: #475569;
  }
  footer {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 8mm;
    left: 18mm;
    right: 18mm;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 8.5pt;
    color: #94a3b8;
    border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    padding-top: 2mm;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="brand">AgentShield · LLM Security Validation</div>
  <h1>Executive Summary · 경영진 요약 보고서</h1>
  <div class="meta">
    <span>Session: <b>{{ session_id }}</b></span>
    <span>Generated: <b>{{ generated_at }}</b></span>
    <span>Status: <b>{{ manifest.package_status }}</b></span>
  </div>
</header>

<h2>한눈에 보기</h2>
<div class="stats">
  <div class="stat-card vuln">
    <div class="label">총 Vulnerable</div>
    <div class="value">{{ manifest.total_findings }}</div>
  </div>
  <div class="stat-card verified">
    <div class="label">Phase 4 검증 통과</div>
    <div class="value">{{ manifest.verified_safe_count }}</div>
  </div>
  <div class="stat-card safe">
    <div class="label">회귀 테스트</div>
    <div class="value">{{ regression_count }}</div>
  </div>
</div>

<h2>카테고리별 위험 분포</h2>
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>OWASP 카테고리</th>
      <th>Verified Safe</th>
      <th>권장 액션</th>
      <th>참조</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {% for cat in category_summary %}
    <tr>
      <td><b>{{ cat.code }}</b> · {{ cat.name }}</td>
      <td>{{ cat.verified_count }}건</td>
      <td>{{ cat.action_label_ko }} <span style="color:#64748b">({{ cat.default_action }})</span></td>
      <td style="font-size:8.5pt;color:#64748b">{{ cat.reference_url }}</td>
    </tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>

<h2>의사결정 권고</h2>
<div class="note">
  본 리포트는 LLM 서비스의 보안 위험을 자동으로 재현하고, Phase 4 재검증을 통과한 방어 방안을 바탕으로
  <b>출시·보류·수정·재점검</b> 의사결정 근거를 제공합니다.
  하단 카테고리별 매핑은 OWASP LLM Top 10 권고안 기반이며, 운영 환경 적용 전 보안팀 리뷰가 필요합니다.
</div>

<h2>다음 단계 (Action Items)</h2>
<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>카테고리</th>
      <th>고쳐야 할 지점</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {% for cat in category_summary %}
    <tr>
      <td><b>{{ cat.code }}</b></td>
      <td>
        <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: 4mm;">
          {% for target in cat.fix_targets %}<li>{{ target }}</li>{% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </td>
    </tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>

<footer>
  AgentShield · {{ generated_at }} · 본 문서에는 민감 정보가 마스킹되어 있습니다 (외부 공유용)
</footer>
</body>
</html>
